; Trailing: stop beyond the EMA(34) of M10 closes, once the profit reaches 0.5R. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 7, TrailParam 34).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only (score 1.43): 115 trades, PF 1.59.
; UNSEEN May 16 - Nov 13 2026, at the backtest's costs (assumed 10 USD spread, no commission): this setup 44 trades, PF 2.43, net +16.6R; the 2 setups of this combination together 102 trades, PF 1.95 (stressed 2.09).
; EARLIER DATA, before the calibration period: 2024: this setup 62 trades, PF 1.50; 2023: this setup 75 trades, PF 1.09. The combination together: 2024 PF 1.04 (156 trades); 2023 PF 1.02 (201 trades). The 2026 result did NOT hold on earlier data: UNPROVEN, demo and Strategy Tester only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT M1 in broker server time, assumed spread 10 USD. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter was not in the backtest.
